@page "/roadmap"

<PageTitle>Roadmap</PageTitle>

<h3>Roadmap</h3>
This is just a list of developments I'm sure I want to pursue, so if new ideas come up in the meantime, the roadmap will be updated.
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center">
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Change</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Refactoring</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Improvement</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Feature</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-asterisk text-primary"></span> Request</div>
</div>
<hr />
